{"name":"Mog battle threads","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":138,"casual":{"lead":["A mog battle thread puts two photos next to each other, such as two users, friends, or celebrities, and asks the forum which face \"mogs\" (looks better than) the other. Members reply with a pick and often a short reason.","For someone working on their appearance, the thread works as a quick outside comparison. Replies usually point to specific features, such as eye area, jaw, skin or hair, that members think decided the matchup, which some users treat as a list of things to improve. No research has examined these threads; they are a community custom."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["A poster uploads two images, sometimes labeled A and B, and titles the thread \"mog battle\" with optional names. Others vote in replies or with a poll and explain their choice. Some threads pit a member's current photos against an earlier photo of themselves, or compare two forum regulars. Threads typically fill within hours to days."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Replies come from anonymous users, can be harsh, and reflect the forum's own taste rather than any measured standard. Posting personal photos to a public forum carries privacy considerations, including that images can be saved and re-shared. Users who are sensitive to criticism may find the feedback distressing."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260223203317/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260114015927/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/"},{"title":"mog battle between my friends","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-betw