e of the 2 most hairmaxxed tiktok slayers","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-battle-of-the-2-most-hairmaxxed-tiktok-slayers.662212/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230301055623/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-battle-of-the-2-most-hairmaxxed-tiktok-slayers.662212/"},{"title":"mog battle whites with the lowest smv on the forum me vs tents","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-whites-with-the-lowest-smv-on-the-forum-me-vs-tents.650512/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230204143958/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-whites-with-the-lowest-smv-on-the-forum-me-vs-tents.650512/"},{"title":"mog battle chang vs chad vs tyrone","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-chang-vs-chad-vs-tyrone.586366/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221015134121/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-chang-vs-chad-vs-tyrone.586366/"},{"title":"mog battle alexbrown84 vs kingofkyiv","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-alexbrown84-vs-kingofkyiv.585539/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221014030158/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-alexbrown84-vs-kingofkyiv.585539/"},{"title":"mog battle eric the icelandic ogre giant vs makinithappen","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-eric-the-icelandic-ogre-giant-vs-makinithappen.584159/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221108031000/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-eric-the-icelandic-ogre-giant-vs-makinithappen.584159/"},{"title":"mog battle chris evans vs me side profiles","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-chris-evans-vs-me-side-profiles.544013/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220807033715/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-chris-evans-vs-me-side-profiles.544013/"},{"title":"mog battle ryan gosling vs me","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-ryan-gosling-vs-me.542278/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220803224642/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-ryan-gosling-vs-me.542278/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Confidence & presence","chain":["Post two faces side by side","Community votes and names deciding features","User learns what peers notice and may work on it"],"effect":"indirect","text":"The thread gives a quick crowd comparison of one face against another. The comments that explain a vote can point toward specific features, such as skin, hair or the eye area, that a person may then choose to work on."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Mog battle threads are a recurring post format on looksmaxxing forums in which two faces are placed side by side and the community votes on which one \"mogs\", meaning looks better than, the other.[1][2] The term \"mogging\" refers to asserting dominance over another person through appearance, and is one of the core vocabulary words of the looksmaxxing community.[3]","Members use the format to see how a face compares with another in the eyes of peers. Replies often name the features they think decided the result, such as the eye area, jawline, or skin, which readers can use as pointers for what to improve.[4][5] Titles on looksmax.org include battles between two users, between a user and a friend, between forum regulars, and between celebrities.[2][5][6] No academic research has studied the format itself."],"infobox":[["Type","Forum post format / community custom"],["Also called","Face-vs-face mog battle, mog poll"],["Main venue","looksmax.org and similar forums"],["Typical content","Two photos and a vote"],["Related terms","Mogging, PSL, rate threads"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["A mog battle begins with an original poster uploading two images and asking which person mogs the other. Many threads carry only the title and the images; others add a prompt such as asking for a verdict from the forum's more experienced raters.[1][2] Replies are short, often a single word naming the winner, and sometimes a line on why.","Matchups vary. Some compare two members, some compare a member to a celebrity or to an earlier photo of themselves, and some compare two friends of the poster.[5][6] Thread titles on looksmax.org show the range, including battles among well-known forum members and a battle between two eye colors.[5][7]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Origins and spread","paras":["The vocabulary comes from the PSL-forum era of looksmaxxing, whose forums rated men's faces on a numeric scale and gave rise to terms such as mogging.[3] Mog battle threads continue that habit of ranking faces against each other and are posted regularly on looksmax.org, with many threads under near-identical titles.[1][8]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Reading the replies","paras":["Commenters frequently justify a vote by pointing to features such as bone structure, facial proportions or skin quality, using forum terms that vary between users.[4] Members who post their own photos report using the replies as a gauge of how they are perceived; the wiki's other entries on facial features describe the measures forum members commonly cite."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Reported downsides","paras":["Responses on forum threads can be blunt, and votes come from a small, self-selected group of users whose standards are specific to the community. Posting identifiable photos online also carries ordinary privacy considerations."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"On looksmax.org, mog battle threads are a common way to settle who looks better and to ask the forum for a verdict.[1][5]","claims":[{"claim":"A side-by-side vote shows which face is objectively better looking","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"The comments reveal which specific features to improve","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"mog battle who mogs","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-who-mogs.1761423/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle between the 3 slayers of the forum","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-the-3-slayers-of-the-forum.1744070/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle vs tigermoggerlol who wins","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-vs-tigermoggerlol-who-wins-gtfih.1717873/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle amber vs green eyed dude","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-amber-vs-green-eyed-dude.1267226/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2024,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1513118/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2024,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260223203317/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260114015927/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/"},{"title":"mog battle between my friends","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-my-friends.1770824/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229082507/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-my-friends.1770824/"},{"title":"mog battle who mogs","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-who-mogs.1761423/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251220182331/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-who-mogs.1761423/"},{"title":"mog battle between the 3 slayers of the forum","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-the-3-slayers-of-the-forum.1744070/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228044731/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-the-3-slayers-of-the-forum.1744070/"},{"title":"mog battle vs tigermoggerlol who wins gtfih","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-vs-tigermoggerlol-who-wins-gtfih.1717873/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251125231042/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-vs-tigermoggerlol-who-wins-gtfih.1717873/"},{"title":"mog battle pre ascension me vs stupid ragebait greyfag user gtfih everyone","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-pre-ascension-me-vs-stupid-ragebait-greyfag-user-gtfih-everyone.1534440/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250907073243/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-pre-ascension-me-vs-stupid-ragebait-greyfag-user-gtfih-everyone.1534440/"},{"title":"mog battle me vs curry salludon","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-me-vs-curry-salludon.1533906/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250720082751/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-me-vs-curry-salludon.1533906/"},{"title":"mog battle loox vs orc","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-loox-vs-orc.1528763/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250720082751/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-loox-vs-orc.1528763/"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1513118/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250720082751/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1513118/"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/thread